      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "BUILD THE PATH\n\nGoal\nGuide every colored object to the ring of the
    same color. The triangle shows the direction the object is facing.\n\nPlace Tiles\n1.
    Select a tile from the top bar.\n2. Click an empty cell to place it.\n3. Tiles
    are pre-oriented. Once placed, you cannot move, rotate, or manually remove them.\n\nObject
    Movement\n\u2022 After every placement, objects automatically follow connected
    paths.\n\u2022 An object stops when the path ends.\n\u2022 On a + tile, choose
    an arrow to determine its direction. It cannot turn backward.\n\u2022 Dark cells
    are obstacles and cannot hold tiles."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
