    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "DWINDLE, RECOVERY, AND STARS\n\nAfter a Delivery\nEvery time an object
    reaches its matching ring:\n\u2022 One random tile from its path is removed.\n\u2022
    One random unused tile is removed from your supply.\n\nRecover a Tile\nIf one
    placement delivers two or more objects and the level continues, choose one tile
    from the Removed panel to recover.\n\nBlocked Objects\nA crossed-out object is
    blocked by the board edge, an obstacle, or an incompatible tile.\n\nStar Goals\n1st
    star: Deliver the required number of objects.\n2nd star: Deliver every object.\n3rd
    star: Complete the bonus goal.\n\nThe level ends when all objects are delivered,
    no object can reach its destination, no tiles remain, or no empty cells remain."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
